# Review previews are served off the VPS over a cloudflared tunnel and are
# never committed -- see MEDIA_DIR in /root/chess/publish_review.py. Committing
# every regenerated preview took this repo to ~1.8 GB and broke the deploy.
#
# Scoped to the generated page directory on purpose: review-chess-kx7/swedish/
# is a hand-made static page whose own small assets DO belong in git.
/review-chess-kx7/*.mp4
/review-chess-kx7/*.jpg
/review-chess-kx7/*.jpeg
/review-chess-kx7/*.png
/review-chess-kx7/*.webm
